  updated="2026-11-16"
>
  <div lang="en">
    <h1>Montral on your phone</h1>
    <p class="lede">Montral is a responsive web app. Open it in your browser or install it as a Progressive Web App (PWA) on a supported device. No native Montral iOS app or TestFlight beta is distributed with this project.</p>
    <p><a class="btn" href="/app"><strong>Open Montral web app</strong></a></p>
    <h2>Install on iPhone or iPad</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Open your Montral server in Safari and sign in.</li>
      <li>Tap <strong>Share</strong>, then <strong>Add to Home Screen</strong>.</li>
      <li>Tap <strong>Add</strong>. Open Montral from your Home Screen like other apps.</li>
    </ol>
    <h2>Install on a computer or Android</h2>
    <p>In a compatible browser, open your Montral server and choose the browser's <strong>Install app</strong> or <strong>Add to Home screen</strong> option if offered. You can always use the regular browser tab instead.</p>
    <h2>What works offline?</h2>
    <p>Only the static interface shell and versioned assets can be cached. Live monitors, incidents, alerts and account information require a connection to your Montral server. Installing the PWA does not create a separate native client or enable APNs notifications.</p>
    <p>See <a href="/docs/self-host">self-hosting instructions</a> or <a href="https://github.com/TheHalfMoon/Montral">the source on GitHub</a>. Public hosting and native app distribution have not been announced.</p>
  </div>
  <div lang="zh-CN">
    <h1>在手机上使用 Montral</h1>
    <p class="lede">Montral 是响应式网页应用。你可以在浏览器中使用，也可以在支持的设备上将其安装为渐进式网页应用（PWA）。本项目目前不提供原生 iOS 应用或 TestFlight 公开测试版。</p>
    <p><a class="btn" href="/app"><strong>打开 Montral 网页应用</strong></a></p>
    <h2>在 iPhone 或 iPad 上安装</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>在 Safari 中打开自己的 Montral 服务器并登录。</li>
      <li>点击<strong>分享</strong>，然后选择<strong>添加到主屏幕</strong>。</li>
      <li>点击<strong>添加</strong>，即可从主屏幕打开 Montral。</li>
    </ol>
    <h2>在电脑或 Android 上安装</h2>
    <p>在兼容的浏览器中打开 Montral 服务器。如果浏览器提供<strong>安装应用</strong>或<strong>添加到主屏幕</strong>选项，可以选择该选项，也可以继续使用普通浏览器标签页。</p>
    <h2>离线时可以使用什么？</h2>
    <p>只有静态界面和带版本的资源文件可以缓存。实时监控、故障、告警和账号信息仍需要连接 Montral 服务器。安装 PWA 并不会创建独立原生客户端，也不会自动启用 APNs 推送。</p>
    <p>请参阅<a href="/docs/self-host">自托管指南</a>或<a href="https://github.com/TheHalfMoon/Montral">GitHub 源码</a>。尚未宣布公共托管服务或原生应用发行计划。</p>
  </div>
</Doc>
